# Static-host fallback for the app-shell routes.
#
# /test, /result and /reset-password are prerendered shells (see
# scripts/prerender.mjs).
#
# On Cloudflare Pages these three rules are inert — Pages 308-redirects a bare
# directory path to its trailing-slash form and serves the index file itself
# before `_redirects` is consulted — but they are what makes the same bundle work
# unchanged on a host that does not do that (Netlify). Rewriting `/test/` to
# `/test/index.html` is pointless on Pages and is reported as an infinite loop,
# and `404` is not a valid status here: Pages serves dist/404.html itself.
/test            /test/index.html             200
/result          /result/index.html           200
/reset-password  /reset-password/index.html   200
